    <comp ref="F201">
      <value>2A_SLOW_125VDC</value>
      <footprint>MonitorPowerLocal:Fuse_Fuse_Littelfuse-NANO2-451_453</footprint>
      <fields>
        <field name="MPN">0454002.MR</field>
        <field name="Design notes">2 A slow fuse per TMR 3 5 V input recommendation. 125 VAC/DC, 50 A interrupt at 125 V; 300 A at 32 VDC. Nominal cold resistance 0.0625 ohm, nominal I2t 8.20 A2s. Same verified 452/454 lands. Startup coordination is still a measurement, not implied by nominal I2t.</field>
