      <property name="Design notes" value="Primary side only. Mate VHR-2N with SVH-41T-P1.1 contacts. Standard VH header rating is 10 A with 16 AWG wire, 250 VAC/DC; this channel branch is allocated less than 1 A. Verify crimp and pin orientation. Never join SYS_GND to MID_CH."/>
      <property name="Footprint candidate" value="MonitorPowerLocal:Connector_JST_JST_VH_B2P-VH_1x02_P3.96mm_Vertical"/>
