    <comp ref="PS201">
      <value>ISOLATED_REGULATED_5V_600mA</value>
      <footprint>MonitorPowerLocal:ProtectionLocal_TRACO_TMR3_SIP8_Single</footprint>
      <fields>
        <field name="MPN">TMR 3-0511</field>
        <field name="Design notes">Upgraded for local Pico and ADC load. TMR 3-0511 single output: 5 V / 600 mA, 3 W, input 4.5 to 9 V. Remote pin 3 open means ON. Pin 4 is absent; physical pins 5 and 8 are NC. Pin 6 is +5, pin 7 is channel MID. Keep primary isolated. Custom footprint follows the visually checked official 15-Apr-2026 SIP8 drawing; verify a physical part before assembly.</field>
