    <comp ref="PS202">
      <value>ISOLATED_REGULATED_5V_200mA</value>
      <footprint>MonitorPowerLocal:Converter_DCDC_Converter_DCDC_TRACO_TMR-1-xxxx_Single_THT</footprint>
      <fields>
        <field name="MPN">TMR 1-0511</field>
        <field name="Design notes">Single isolated output, NOT the dual-output part. 1 W, 5 V / 200 mA; 4.5 to 9 V at module input pins. Pins 3 and 5 are absent. Two independent output pairs are series-connected only at this channel MID. MID terminal is passive for ERC because it is the selected output reference. Body 17 x 7.62 x 11 mm; pin locations 0, 2.54, 7.62, 12.70 mm. Bench design, not a medical isolation certification.</field>
