      <footprint>MonitorPowerLocal:Resistor_THT_R_Axial_DIN0207_L6.3mm_D2.5mm_P10.16mm_Horizontal</footprint>
      <fields>
        <field name="MPN">MRS25000C1500FRP00</field>
        <field name="Design notes">Positive TMR 3 preload. 150 ohm, 1%, 50 ppm/K, 0.6 W at 70 C. At the 4.84 V rail corner it draws at least 31.95 mA, above the 30 mA lower load-regulation test point. Body maximum 6.5 x 2.5 mm; lead pitch selected 10.16 mm. Additional to sensing-core bleeders.</field>
