    <comp ref="R202">
      <value>220R_1%_0.6W</value>
      <footprint>MonitorPowerLocal:Resistor_THT_R_Axial_DIN0207_L6.3mm_D2.5mm_P10.16mm_Horizontal</footprint>
      <fields>
        <field name="MPN">MRS25000C2200FRP00</field>
        <field name="Design notes">Standalone rail preload. 220 ohm, 1%, 50 ppm/K, 0.6 W at 70 C. Body maximum 6.5 x 2.5 mm, 0.6 mm leads; selected 10.16 mm pitch exceeds the 10 mm minimum bend spacing. This is additional to the sensing core 470 ohm bleeders. Use 220 rather than 240 ohm to remain above 20 mA at the stated low rail corner.</field>
