      <footprint>MonitorPowerLocal:Package_TO_SOT_THT_TO-92_Inline_Wide</footprint>
      <fields>
        <field name="MPN">MCP1702-3302E/TO</field>
        <field name="Design notes">TO-92 pin numbering is 1 GND, 2 VIN, 3 VOUT. Wide 2.54 mm footprint requires forming the outer leads from nominal 1.27 mm spacing; support the body while forming. Budget 30 mA maximum total 3.3 V load. Include output, load and line regulation. Do not parallel existing ISOW7741 output.</field>
